<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela Fogade to sell Latino Seguros May 15.</title>
<headline>Venezuela Fogade to sell Latino Seguros May 15.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's Deposits Guarantee Fund (Fogade) said it would hold a May 15 auction to sell insurance company Latino de Seguros for a minimum price of 1.3 billion bolivars ($2.7 million).</p>
<p>It said in a press release ten foreign investors, all from Latin America and the Caribbean, have shown an interest in buying the small insurance company.</p>
<p>A first auction last November was called off after no bids were presented.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
